+- [JST1996] C. Jagger, P. Šťovíček and A. Thomason, Multiplicities of subgraphs, *Combinatorica* 16 (1996), 123–141.
+- [Pin2026] R. Pinho, *C89c >= 0.000021083: an exact flag-algebra certificate*, GitHub repository [rpinho/math-certificates](https://github.com/rpinho/math-certificates/tree/7226df047246ff06c3afeb953dddadfa196ed3cd/c89c-flag-certificate), unrefereed, 1 November 2026. AI-assisted analysis.
